        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9fb9bfaa-0304-4d1a-a60b-ad86a9bd0961\",\"review_text\":\"Been offline for a few days now, also there should be a \\\"pay now, update payment\\\" feature within the app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"57796843-b718-441a-921d-8dfac3fbc679\",\"review_text\":\"This is too much they should probably make the whole platform and user interface paid this is too much ads and lyrics were ok we get it but this is too much very disappointed and dissatisfied with there actions👎👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"5359cb77-07f0-4673-b1b3-fbf76a7b1124\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application 👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"d65a9dd3-8ef8-446c-9675-bd0f307a033f\",\"review_text\":\"Love Spotify, but the new UI (March 2023) is not friendly to my neurodivergent brain. I feel that it is overwhelming. I have to scroll and scroll and scroll just to find things that were easily accessible before.\"},{\"review_id\":\"4d95fb31-04a7-4bf4-8ed7-9963f0e760b4\",\"review_text\":\"This aap is very good no any but use So I love it 💞💞💞\"},{\"review_id\":\"71b343e1-d054-49ac-85a5-384fc78033ef\",\"review_text\":\"Can't do without it\"},{\"review_id\":\"b53e7ed6-595a-4ed4-876e-3fa6dac94947\",\"review_text\":\"Worst experience!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"1626ee7e-fcb3-49c4-931a-babf6ee25edd\",\"review_text\":\"The best! Simple, easy to use and organize my favorite music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"85d5289e-0ca6-4d3d-bcc0-4e0ba0f2e68e\",\"review_text\":\"yeyeh\"},{\"review_id\":\"bdecf249-9580-4e0b-ba17-be1ce21cdb00\",\"review_text\":\"I downloaded this app to listen music but I got ads to listen more than songs.this is what made me hate this app. Its the worst app to listen songs\"}]}"
